{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45610","headline":"了仙谣 · 贯休","name":"了仙谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海中紫雾蓬莱岛，安期子乔去何早。\n游戏多骑白骐驎，须发如银未曾老。\n亦留仙诀在人间，啮镞终言药非道。\n始皇不得此深旨，远遣徐福生忧恼。\n紫术黄精心上苗，大还小还行中宝。\n若师方术弃心师，浪似雪山何处讨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45610.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45610","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}